            "UMQ6LR9NZ"
        ],
        "is_locked": false,
        "subscribed": false,
        "blocks": [
            {
                "type": "rich_text",
                "block_id": "q0mCG",
                "elements": [
                    {
                        "type": "rich_text_section",
                        "elements": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "I've been doing a "
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "link",
                                "url": "https://eli.li/december-adventure",
                                "text": "December Adventure"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": ", which is a lovely little thing initiated by "
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "user",
                                "user_id": "UMQ6LR9NZ"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": ". I should have mentioned this a week ago, but like\u2026 it's never too late to hop on board! The gist of it is\u2026 well, actually, here's how "
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "I personally interpret it, even though this is at odds with the \"official\" post",
                                "style": {
                                    "italic": true
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "::::\n\nYou should do a weird little extra thing every day. Something you don't normally do. Maybe it's creative. Maybe it's coding. Doesn't matter. But try to find a space moment in your day to do a weird little extra thing.\n\nTry not to feel any pangs if you miss a day. Don't dread it. Just look for an opportunity to try something out.\n\nAnd, if the spirit moves you, post about it somewhere. Maybe on your personal website \u2014 I've been posting my "
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "link",
                                "url": "https://ivanish.ca/december-adventure/",
                                "text": "december adventures"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": " on my personal website, natch. But a lot of folks (and there are, in fact, quite a few folks doing this now, which is truly humbling) post on Mastodon about it. Or you could just post here in "
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "channel",
                                "channel_id": "C03RR0W5DGC"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": ". That'd be great.\n\nIf you're doing a December Adventure, let me know!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        ],
